<title>PORTUGAL: Oct Portugal jobless rose 4.7 pct yr/yr to 457,126.</title>
<headline>Oct Portugal jobless rose 4.7 pct yr/yr to 457,126.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of registered unemployed in Portugal rose 1.3 percent month-on-month in October to 457,126, up 4.7 percent year-on-year, the Institute for Employment and Professional Training (IFEP) said.</p>
<p>				    Oct 96   Sept 96    Oct 95</p>
<p> Registered unemployed     457,126    451,174    436,663</p>
<p>NOTE - The IEFP does not express the number of unemployed as a percentage of the total labour force. Its figures for the number of people out of work are consistently higher than those of the National Statistics Institute (INE), the government's official yardstick for unemployment.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
